# The Linux libmpv vendor tree is a *build product*, produced by
# scripts/release/build-linux-libmpv.mjs inside the release runner (task 2.2)
# rather than committed. Its provenance documents must still be trackable so
# they can be committed: without these two lines `*.so` would take
# manifest.json and NOTICE.md down with it, and task 2.2's "落仓" and
# task-9.7's per-file SHA-256 gate would have nothing to read.
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/vendor/libmpv/linux/manifest.json
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/vendor/libmpv/linux/NOTICE.md
venv/
.venv/
env/
.env
